const tnSort=()=>[...TN].sort((a,b)=>{const o={live:0,upcoming:1,ended:2};return o[a.status]-o[b.status]||(a.status=='ended'?b.start-a.start:a.start-b.start)});
function tnChip(x){return `<span class="tch ${x.status}">${x.status=='live'?'<i></i>':''}${SN[x.status]}</span>`}
function tnCard(x){const ac=AC[x.mode]||AC.overall;return `<div class="tnc" data-tn="${x.id}" style="--ac:${ac};--ab:${ac}33"><div class="tr1"><img src="${IC[x.mode]}" alt="" ${PXL(x.mode)}>${tnChip(x)}</div><div class="tnm">${x.name}</div><div class="tms">${mname(x.mode)} &middot; ${x.status=='ended'?'Ended '+when(x.start):x.status=='live'?'In progress':'Starts '+when(x.start)}</div><div class="tfx"><span>Prize ${x.prize}</span><span>${x.np}/${x.max}</span></div></div>`}
function tnHome(){const L=tnSort().slice(0,5);return `<div class="panel"><div class="lmh"><svg class="hi" viewBox="0 0 24 24">${SVG.trophy}</svg>Tournaments<span class="all" data-p="tournaments">View all &rsaquo;</span></div>${L.length?`<div class="tns">${L.map(tnCard).join('')}</div>`:'<div class="nb2">No tournaments yet</div>'}</div>`}
function tournaments(){const L=tnSort().filter(x=>tf=='all'||x.status==tf);return `<div class="sech" style="margin-top:4px">Tournaments</div><div class="ptabs tft">${[['all','All'],['live','Live'],['upcoming','Upcoming'],['ended','Ended']].map(([k,l])=>`<button class="${tf==k?'on':''}" data-tf="${k}">${l}</button>`).join('')}</div>${L.length?`<div class="tgrid">${L.map(x=>tnCard(x).replace('class="tnc"','class="tnc wide"')).join('')}</div>`:'<div class="panel nb2">Nothing here yet</div>'}`}
function bracket(R){const nm=R.length==3?['Quarterfinals','Semifinals','Final']:R.map((_,i)=>i==R.length-1?'Final':'Round '+(i+1));return `<div class="br">${R.map((ms,i)=>`<div class="bcol"><div class="bh2">${nm[i]}</div>${ms.map(m=>`<div class="bm">${[['a','sa','sb'],['b','sb','sa']].map(([n,s,o])=>`<div class="bp${m[s]!=null&&m[o]!=null&&m[s]>m[o]?' win':''}"><span class="ign">${m[n]||'TBD'}</span><b>${m[s]==null?'–':m[s]}</b></div>`).join('')}</div>`).join('')}</div>`).join('')}</div>`}
function tournament(){const x=TN.find(y=>y.id==tn);if(!x)return '<div class="bk2" data-back>&larr; Back</div><div class="panel nb2">Tournament not found</div>';const ac=AC[x.mode]||AC.overall,R=x.rounds,fin=R&&R[R.length-1][0],ch=fin&&fin.sa!=null?(fin.sa>fin.sb?fin.a:fin.b):null,ru=ch?(ch==fin.a?fin.b:fin.a):null,pp2=n=>{const p=P.find(q=>q.n==n);return p?`<div class="av" style="width:44px;height:44px;border-width:2px" data-pl="${p.i}">${fig(p,1)}</div>`:''};
let h=`<div class="bk2" data-back>&larr; Back</div><div class="mbn" style="--ac:${ac};--ab:${ac}33"><div class="mic"><img src="${IC[x.mode]}" alt="" ${PXL(x.mode)}></div><div><div class="m1">TOURNAMENT</div><div class="m2" style="font-size:22px">${x.name}</div>${tnChip(x)}</div></div>
<div class="tiles"><div><small>Prize</small><b style="font-size:20px">${x.prize}</b></div><div><small>Players</small><b>${x.np}/${x.max}</b></div><div><small>${x.status=='upcoming'?'Starts':'Started'}</small><b style="font-size:18px">${new Date(x.start).toLocaleString([],{month:'short',day:'numeric',hour:'2-digit',minute:'2-digit'})}</b></div><div><small>Host</small><b style="font-size:18px">${x.host}</b></div></div>
<div class="panel" style="margin-top:12px"><p class="abt">${x.desc||'No description yet.'}</p><div class="inf"><div>Gamemode</div><div>${mname(x.mode)}</div><div>Format</div><div>${x.fmt}</div>${x.server?`<div>Server</div><div>${x.server}</div>`:''}${x.region&&x.region!='Any'?`<div>Region</div><div>${x.region}</div>`:''}${x.checkin?`<div>Check-in</div><div>${x.checkin} min before</div>`:''}</div>${x.status!='ended'?'<button class="dcb btn0" data-soon="Register in the Discord #tournaments channel">Register on Discord</button>':''}</div>`;
if(ch)h+=`<div class="sech">Winners</div><div class="panel win2"><div>${pp2(ch)}<small>Champion</small><b class="ign">${ch}</b></div><div>${pp2(ru)}<small>Runner-up</small><b class="ign">${ru}</b></div></div>`;
if(R)h+=`<div class="sech">Bracket</div><div class="panel">${bracket(R)}</div>`;
else h+=`<div class="sech">Registered players</div><div class="panel"><div class="chp">${x.players.slice(0,16).map(n=>{const p=P.find(q=>q.n==n);return `<span ${p?`data-pl="${p.i}"`:''}>${n}</span>`}).join('')}${x.np>16?`<span class="more">+${x.np-16} more</span>`:''}</div></div>`;
return h}
const RULES=[['General',['Be respectful. No hate speech, harassment, threats or discrimination.','One account per player. Alt accounts and impersonation are not allowed.','Do not advertise other servers or Discords.','Staff decisions are final. Argue calmly in a ticket, not in public channels.']],
['Fair play',['No hacked clients, x-ray, kill aura, reach, auto-clickers or macros.','Touch, controller and keyboard are all allowed. Only vanilla Bedrock features are allowed.','Do not abuse bugs. Report them to staff instead.','No win-trading, boosting, teaming or throwing matches.']],
['Matches and tier tests',['Be on time. Waiting more than 10 minutes means a forfeit.','Leaving a match early counts as a loss.','If lag ruins a match, ask staff for a rematch right away.','You may need to record or screen-share your match if staff ask.','Each gamemode has a retest cooldown (default: 30 days).']],
['Tournaments',['Register in Discord before the deadline and check in 15 minutes before start.','Brackets and formats are shown on each tournament page.','Late players are disqualified.','Dispute a result with a recording within 24 hours.','Prizes are paid after staff verify the results.']],
['Punishments',['Warning, then mute or kick, then temporary ban, then permanent ban.','Cheating and exploiting are permanent bans.','Appeal in a ticket within 14 days of the ban.']]];
const FAQ=[['How do I get ranked?','Join our Discord, open a tier test for a gamemode and play your match. Your tier shows up on the Tiers page after it is saved.'],['Why can\'t I see my tier?','Your Discord account must be linked and you need at least one tested gamemode. Unranked gamemodes are shown in gray.'],['How do retests work?','You can retest a gamemode after its cooldown. Your highest tier counts for points.'],['How do I report a cheater?','Open a ticket in our Discord with the player name and a recording if you have one.'],['How do I appeal a ban?','Open a ticket within 14 days and explain what happened.'],['Which devices can play?','Bedrock Edition on mobile, Windows and consoles.']];
